Subject: [PATCH] Highlight and scroll to the currently playing item in lists

When a track starts playing, lists (library song lists, playlists, albums,
the play queue) now highlight the row of the playing item, scroll it into
view if it is off-screen and move keyboard focus to it when focus is not
elsewhere. The same happens when a list is rendered or its page is shown
again while something is playing.
